NOTE ON THIRD-PARTY DATA (not covered by this license):

This repository does NOT redistribute the KROGER hybrid-functional defect
database (Arnab et al., PCCP 2025), which is third-party published work
consumed only numerically as an energetics input. Only our own computed
extensions and derived comparison tables (level positions and residuals) are
included. To reproduce the steps that read the database, obtain it from the
original source (see Ga2O3-Sandbox/data/energetics/kroger_ga2o3_092724.provenance.json).

Quantum ESPRESSO ONCV pseudopotentials used for the DFT/HSE calculations are
third-party and are not redistributed here; obtain them from their upstream
source. The MLIP-relaxed and melt-quench structures under
Ga2O3-Sandbox/dft/ (mace_relax, disorder_ensemble, disorder_mattersim, sputter_films) are our own
computed outputs and are covered by this license.
